<title>HONG KONG: Korea First Bank to set US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Korea First Bank to set US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Chase Manhattan Asia.</p>
<p>The issue has been pre-launched to the market and general syndication will begin on December 11.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOREA FIRST BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$100 MLN  COUPON     6ML+35   MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	   ISS PRICE  PAR	RE-OFFER  99.865*</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS	NONE     LAUNCH    11.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING    LUXEMBOURG  REPAYMENT  BULLET   DENOMS    US$250K</p>
<p> RATING     BAA1/BBB+   SALE LMTS  STANDARD TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	   CRS DEF    YES	FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  S.KOREA     GOV LAW    ENGLISH  PAY DATE  27.DEC.96</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MGRS    US$10 MLN   25.5 BP   ALL-IN  43.5</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	  US$4-5 MLN  25.5 BP   ALL-IN  43.5</p>
<p>   CO-MANAGERS     US$3 MLN    25.5 BP   ALL-IN  43.5</p>
<p> SOLE ARRANGER   CHASE MANHATTAN ASIA</p>
<p> NOTES     *YIELDS LIBOR+40 BP ON A DISCOUNTED MARGIN BASIS.</p>
<p>	     SIGNING IS SET FOR DECEMBER 18.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
